# Select a character and then ask for the things only a server can author.
#
# This is the script that pays for the lane: everything below the selection is
# data no shipped file holds — station contents, the skill queue, dogma state,
# corporation rows, agent journals, a market with a region behind it.
#
# The ids are the ones a particular EvEJS install happens to hold. Read them
# off a `charsel.probe` run's `charUnboundMgr.GetCharacterSelectionData` line
# and edit this file; that is the whole reason the script is data.
#
#   charID    140000005
#   corpID     98000001
#   allianceID 99000001
#   stationID  60003760   (Jita IV - Moon 4)
#   systemID   30000142   (Jita)
#   regionID   10000002   (The Forge)
#
#   probe run --script crates/eve-probe/scripts/ingame.probe --out <dir>

note stage 4h: selecting a character
call charUnboundMgr.SelectCharacterID 140000005
drain 8000

note stage 4i: the character sheet and what the client loads with it
call charMgr.GetSettingsInfo
call charMgr.GetCharacterSettings
call charMgr.GetPublicInfo 140000005
call skillMgr2.GetMySkillHandler
call paperDollServer.GetPaperDollData 140000005
call userSvc.GetMultiCharactersTrainingSlots [140000005]
call home_station.get_home_station

note stage 4j: bound objects — skills, dogma, inventory, crimewatch
bind skillHandler 140000005 GetSkills
bind dogmaIM (30000142, 5) GetAllInfo true, true, none
bind invbroker (30000142, 5) GetInventoryFromId 140000005, 1
bind crimewatch (30000142, 5) GetClientStates

note stage 4j2: calls on the objects those binds returned
# `bind` labels the object with its service name; the fused call's own return
# value, when that is also an object, is labelled `<service>.retval`.
on skillHandler GetSkillQueueAndFreePoints
on crimewatch GetClientStates
on dogmaIM GetCharacterBaseAttributes
on invbroker.retval List

note stage 4k: corporation and alliance
bind corpRegistry 98000001 GetAggressionSettings
bind warRegistry (98000001, 1) GetWars 98000001
call corpRegistry.GetCorporationIDsWithTheirAllianceID [98000001]
call allianceRegistry.GetAlliance 99000001

note stage 4l: agents, missions and standings for a real character
call agentMgr.GetAgents
call agentMgr.GetMyJournalDetails
call standingMgr.GetCharStandings
call standingMgr.GetMyKillRights
call bountyProxy.GetBountiesAndKillRights

note stage 4m: the station we are docked in
call station.GetGuests
call stationSvc.GetStationItemBits 60003760
call structureDirectory.GetMyDockableStructures 30000142

note stage 4n: the market, now that the session has a region
call marketProxy.StartupCheck
call marketProxy.GetRegionBest 10000002
call marketProxy.GetOrders 10000002, 34
call marketProxy.GetCharOrders
call marketProxy.GetMarketGroups

note stage 4o: wallet, industry and the rest of the long tail
call account.GetCashBalance 0
call account.GetJournal 1000, none, 140000005, none, none
call contractMgr.NumRequiringAttention
call lootSvc.GetLootRights
call jumpTimers.GetTimers 140000005
call keeper.GetCurrentDungeonForCharacter

note stage 4p: drain the tail
drain 6000
